    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it brings new conversations, but it feels like the actual craftsmanship is being lost in the process. like, it's becoming more about the \"statement\" than the skill. wouldn't you say that when art prioritizes activism over aesthetic mastery, it loses its status as art and just becomes propaganda?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
